    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but talking to someone doesn't change the biology of it. they can give me meds and therapy but they cant rewrite my blood. it feels more like a math problem than a mental health issue. like, if the pattern is already there, why am i even fighting to keep the cycle going? it just feels like i'm delaying the inevitable.",
